    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7e4240b8beb372b4f17278a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……此地流传着这样的传说。\n“在一次呼吸之间，从下界前进至龙之宝座，\n祈祷者心中阴霾即可驱散。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "9359b92aa1de6e787fab7c884555e770286a87c69ecef29c48124f6bf82d571f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047707.json",
      "json_path": [
