      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也就是不间断地一口气冲上神社位处的高地后，\n对着神木献上祈祷。\n听说这样就能净化心灵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db4083223668526a1a8dd121ea98ac9287400f787221600b469698f40508ad17",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
