      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……不过同时还说──\n“倘若失败，心灵将被更加深沉的污秽占据”……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4df32c723d0ec1338a345a4bcc2dad287c8b9b85e00fd9545ec89ed2c2b5294f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
